# lineage-23.2: prebuilt/ IS tracked. It holds the kernel the ROM ships -- the
# Neutron-built custom kernel (itel-rs4-kernel), imported by
# device/itel/S666LN/import-kernel.sh after it proves the Image is the one inside
# the published boot image and the KMI gate passes on both module sets.
# There is no from-source fallback on this branch (BoardConfig.mk $(error)s
# without it), so a clone without prebuilt/ could not build at all.
# (lineage-20.0 ignored prebuilt/ because it could fall back to a GKI source build.)

# Markdown: only the root README is published; every other .md stays local.
*.md
!/README.md
